begin;
insert into public.support_guide (id, title, checked, keywords, body) values
  ('about', 'What SellerFlowLive does', '2026-10-11'::date, 'about, what is, sellerflowlive, app, live selling, tiktok, facebook, ano ito, paano gumagana, 是什么, 功能, 介紹', 'SellerFlowLive helps you sell on live video without writing orders in a notebook.

- **Connect** your TikTok account while you are live. Comments come into the **Live** screen.
- Turn a comment into an order with **1-Click** or **Type price**, or let **Auto mode** do it from product codes.
- Every buyer gets a **buyer number** for the whole session, so you can sort bags by number.
- Orders print on a **Bluetooth sticker printer** (like the AIMO D520BT) or a **WiFi receipt printer**.
- See your orders in **Orders**, your numbers in **Sales**, and your items and stock in **Products**.

The app works in English, Filipino, Bahasa Indonesia, Tiếng Việt, 中文 (简体), 中文 (繁體), ไทย and Български. Printer connection and live connect work in the SellerFlowLive phone app; some things (like exporting files) work better in a browser on a computer.'),
  ('screens', 'Main screens and the bottom bar', '2026-10-11'::date, 'screens, menu, bottom bar, tabs, navigation, where, nasaan, saan makikita, live, orders, products, sales, settings, 在哪里, 選單, 页面', 'The bar at the bottom of the app has five buttons:

- **Live** — pick your live source, **Connect**, and watch comments come in. Each comment has **1-Click** and **Type price** buttons. Ordered comments show **Printed** / **Reprint**. The header shows your session (for example "Session ends …") and how many buyers and orders you have.
- **Sales** — your sales report: totals, trends, top buyers and best sellers.
- **Orders** — every order in this session, with search, date ranges and **Print slip**. A tab at the top switches to **Miners** (your top buyers).
- **Products** — your items, prices, stock and **Live code** for Auto mode.
- **Settings** — shop tools and your account (see the "Settings screen" section).'),
  ('settings-tiles', 'The Settings screen', '2026-10-11'::date, 'settings, tiles, shop tools, account, general settings, customers, log out, setting, ayos, 设置, 設定, 账号', 'Tap **Settings** in the bottom bar. You will see tiles:

- **Invite friends** — share the app link with other sellers.
- **General Settings** — profile, live session options, look, language, channels, printer, subscription, support, delete account.
- **Customers** — your buyers list with search.
- **Parcel Scan** (7-11 / FamilyMart), **Customer Details**, **Pickup Status** — Taiwan tools. Depending on your plan they open, show a 🔒 lock, or say **Coming soon**.
- **Shipping** — shows **Coming soon** for sellers in Taiwan.
- **Privacy & Terms**
- **Need help? Contact us** — opens Telegram @SellerFlowLive.
- **Delete Account**
- **Log out** — logs out this device only.'),
  ('general-settings', 'General Settings', '2026-10-11'::date, 'general settings, profile, shop name, phone, live session, appearance, channels, printer, subscription, support, baguhin, 一般设置, 個人資料', '**Settings → General Settings** has these parts:

- **BASIC INFORMATION** — Shop name, Owner name, Phone, Email. Tap **Edit**, change, then **Save changes**. Owner name and shop name are required.
- **LIVE SESSION** — **Keep screen awake while live**, **Auto-print pinned comments**, **Auto mode**, **Same price for all items**, and **LIVE print pattern**. Turning one on shows a short explanation first; tap **Turn on** to confirm.
- **APPEARANCE** — Theme (☀ Light / ☾ Dark), Accent color, Animations, Language, Currency.
- **CHANNELS** — TikTok Live and Facebook Live rows. Tap one to manage your accounts.
- **Printer Settings** — tap **Printer**, then under **CHOOSE PRINTER** pick the WiFi receipt printer or the Bluetooth sticker printer.
- **ACCOUNT** — **Subscription** (not shown on iPhone), **Support & user guide**, **Delete account**.'),
  ('plans', 'Plans: Free, Basic, Plus, Pro, Master', '2026-10-11'::date, 'plan, plans, subscription, free, basic, plus, pro, master, which plan, features, anong plan, 方案, 订阅, 哪個方案', 'There are five plans. What the app shows per plan:

| Plan | Live accounts | Order limit | Parcel Scan / Customer Details / Pickup Status (Taiwan only) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Free | 1 | 20 orders in total (see "Free order limit") | 🔒 locked |
| Basic | 1 | unlimited | 🔒 locked |
| Plus | 2 | unlimited | Pickup Status and parcel check: automatic. Parcel Scan: see that section |
| Pro | 3 | unlimited | same as Plus |
| Master | 5 | unlimited | same as Plus |

- The account number is the **total across all live platforms**.
- "Print QR on sticker" is on every plan.
- 7-11 Shipping is **Coming soon** for sellers.
- To see your plan, open **Settings → General Settings → Subscription** (it shows CURRENT PLAN, days left and renew date).
- Payment is done outside the app through Telegram. Message Admin on Telegram @SellerFlowLive to subscribe, upgrade or renew.
- This guide does not quote prices. For prices, message Admin.'),
  ('account-limit', 'Account limit per plan', '2026-10-11'::date, 'account limit, accounts, multi account, add account, limit reached, ilang account, dagdag account, 账号上限, 多帳號, 帳號數量', 'Your plan sets how many live accounts you can have **in total across all live platforms**: Free 1, Basic 1, Plus 2, Pro 3, Master 5.

Messages you may see:
- "Accounts used: 2 of 3" — your count.
- "Plan account limit reached" or "⚠ Your plan''s account limit is reached. Upgrade to add more."
- "Only your N oldest can go live" / "Not covered by your plan" — you have more accounts than your plan covers. Only the oldest ones can go live.

What to do:
1. Remove an account you no longer use, or
2. Upgrade your plan: message Admin on Telegram @SellerFlowLive.
3. To add an extra TikTok account beyond your plan, tap **Add TikTok — Multi Account** and message Admin on Telegram.'),
  ('free-order-limit', 'Free plan order limit', '2026-10-11'::date, 'free, free plan, 20 orders, order limit, cap, limit reached, reset, upgrade, libre, naubos, 免费, 免費額度, 订单上限', 'On the **Free** plan you can create **20 orders in total**. They **do not reset** — there is no monthly refill. Upgrade for unlimited orders. Paid plans do not have this limit.

- When you are close, a popup says "You''re almost there!" and how many free orders are left.
- When you reach it, the popup says you''ve used all your free orders. New orders are not created after this.
- Tap **Upgrade plan** to see your plan, or **View my orders** to see what you have.
- To upgrade, message Admin on Telegram @SellerFlowLive. On iPhone the popup says "Free limit reached… Please contact support."

You can see "Free orders used" on **Settings → General Settings → Subscription**.'),
  ('plan-expired', 'Plan expired or expiring', '2026-10-11'::date, 'expired, expire, plan ended, renew, renewal, inactive, nag-expire, tapos na plan, 过期, 到期, 續費', 'Before your plan ends, the app shows "Your plan expires in N days" or "Your plan expires today". After it ends: "Your plan has expired. Renew to keep your live sessions and printing running." Tap **Renew now**.

After your plan ends you can only **view your history** (orders, sales). To go live and print again, renew. If you tap Connect you may see: "Your plan has ended. Renew to connect again."

To renew:
1. Message Admin on Telegram @SellerFlowLive (**Renew via Telegram** on the Subscription screen).
2. Pay as Admin explains.
3. Admin activates your plan. Close the app fully and open it again so it loads your new plan.

On iPhone the messages say "Your account expires…" and "Contact support".'),
  ('payment', 'Paying for a plan', '2026-10-11'::date, 'payment, pay, renew, upgrade, telegram, bayad, magbayad, paano magbayad, 付款, 付费, 續訂', 'Payment is not done inside the app.

1. Message Admin on Telegram @SellerFlowLive. Say which plan you want and your account email.
2. Admin tells you how to pay.
3. After payment, Admin activates your plan.
4. Fully close the app and open it again.

This guide does not quote prices. For prices, message Admin. Plans run month to month.'),
  ('connect-tiktok', 'Connect your TikTok live', '2026-10-11'::date, 'connect, tiktok, go live, live, link account, comments, ikonek, paano mag-connect, 连接, 連線, 直播, 抖音', '1. **Go live on TikTok first.** Your account must already be live when you connect.
2. Open SellerFlowLive and tap **Live** in the bottom bar.
3. Tap the **TikTok** tile.
4. Pick your account and tap **Connect**. No account yet? Type your TikTok @username (the exact username that is going live) and add it.
5. If no session is running, choose how long the session lasts (see "Session length").
6. When connected you see "Connected!" and comments start coming in.

Messages:
- "Account is not live right now — start your TikTok LIVE first." Go live, then tap Connect again.
- "Too many connects. Wait N minutes, then try again." Wait, then tap Connect once.
- "Can''t connect right now. Check your internet and try again."

Tip: tap **Connect** once and wait. Tapping many times can cause the wait message.'),
  ('connect-facebook', 'Facebook live (activation required)', '2026-10-11'::date, 'facebook, fb, facebook page, facebook live, activation, activate, hindi ma-connect fb, 脸书, 臉書, 粉丝页, 啟用', 'Facebook live **needs activation**. If it is not activated for you, the Facebook tile shows "Advanced feature — activation required" and a **Contact us** button. To ask for it, message Admin on Telegram @SellerFlowLive.

When Facebook is activated for you:
1. Go to **Settings → General Settings → Facebook Live → Manage Facebook pages**.
2. Tap **Connect my Facebook Page**. Facebook opens. Tick **only** the Page you sell from. Personal profiles and Groups can''t be used.
3. Go live on Facebook from that Page, then on **Live** tap the Facebook tile and **Connect**.

Common messages:
- "That page isn''t live right now — start your Facebook LIVE first."
- "Facebook needs you to connect your Page again." Authorize the Page again in Facebook pages.
- "This Page was connected on another phone, so this one stopped receiving."'),
  ('other-platforms', 'Instagram and Shopee', '2026-10-11'::date, 'instagram, ig, shopee, other platform, coming soon, wala pa, kailan, 虾皮, 蝦皮, ig直播, 即将推出', 'On the **Live** screen you see four tiles: TikTok, Facebook, Instagram and Shopee.

- **Instagram** and **Shopee** show **Coming soon** for most sellers and cannot be tapped.
- Do not promise a date. If a seller asks, they can message Admin on Telegram @SellerFlowLive.'),
  ('session-length', 'Choosing the session length', '2026-10-11'::date, 'session, session length, days, multi-day, 1 day, 3 days, start session, ilang araw, haba ng session, 场次, 天数, 直播天數', 'When you tap **Connect** and no session is running, the app asks **Start a live session** and you choose: **1 day** ("Ship same day") up to **5 days** ("N-day live before sending").

- **1 day** starts right away.
- **2 to 5 days** asks you to confirm: "You can''t change the length until this session ends." Tap **Confirm** (or **Back**).
- **Cancel** / ✕ stops the connect. No session starts.

Buyer numbers stay continuous for the whole session. The day you start counts as day 1. The session ends at **midnight Taiwan time (UTC+8)** after the last day, and the header shows "Session ends {date}". After it ends, the next Connect asks for a new length and buyer numbers start again at #1.'),
  ('buyer-numbers', 'Buyer numbers', '2026-10-11'::date, 'buyer number, buyer #, numbering, reset, restart, number 1, numero, bumalik sa 1, 买家编号, 買家編號, 號碼重置', '- Each buyer gets **one number for the whole session**. Buyer #5 stays #5 on every order in that session.
- Numbers reset to **#1 only when a new session starts**. That happens after your session''s last day ends, or if you switch live source ("Switch to …? This ends your current capture and starts a new session — buyers restart at #1").
- In a **multi-day session** (2 to 5 days) numbers continue across all days. They do not reset at midnight.
- Numbers are the **same on every device** logged in to your account (phone + computer), and stay the same after refresh or logging in again.

If you see "Couldn''t load this session''s buyers. Orders are paused so buyer numbers don''t repeat" tap **Retry** after checking your internet. If you see "Session still loading — that order wasn''t created", wait a moment and try again.

If numbers look wrong, fully close the app on every device and open it again, then tap Connect once.'),
  ('one-click-orders', '1-Click and Type price orders', '2026-10-11'::date, '1-click, one click, type price, enterprise, order, print order, price, mag-order, presyo, 一键, 一鍵下單, 输入价格', 'Every comment on the **Live** screen has two buttons:

- **1-Click** — creates the order and prints the sticker right away with the comment text. The price is 0 unless **Same price for all items** is on.
- **Type price** — type the price, then tap ✓ (or press Enter) to **Print this order**.

After an order, the row shows **Printed** and a **Reprint** button. A comment can only make one order, so you won''t get duplicates by tapping again.

If the comment is a sold-out Auto mode code, the app asks "{code} is sold out. Continue anyway?" You can still sell it.

Some comment rows show tags like **NEW** ("New account (under 7 days) with no followers") or **CHECK** to warn you about risky buyers.'),
  ('same-price', 'Same price for all items', '2026-10-11'::date, 'same price, fixed price, all items, price, isang presyo, pare-pareho presyo, 统一价, 同價, 固定價格', '**Settings → General Settings → LIVE SESSION → Same price for all items**.

1. Turn it on, type the price, and tap **Turn on**.
2. While it is on, every **1-Click** and **Auto** order prints this price, whatever the buyer types. In **Type price**, the price is filled in for you but you can still change it.
3. Turn it off with **Turn off**. The app remembers the price for next time.'),
  ('auto-mode', 'Auto mode (live codes)', '2026-10-11'::date, 'auto mode, auto, code, live code, automatic order, sold out, awtomatiko, code ng item, 自动, 自動下單, 代码, 口令', 'Auto mode turns comments into orders by itself.

Set up:
1. Go to **Products**, edit a product, and fill in **Live code** (for example A1). Set its **Price** and **Stock**.
2. Turn on **Settings → General Settings → LIVE SESSION → Auto mode**.

During the live:
- Announce the code. Buyers who type the code **exactly** get an order, first come first served, until stock runs out.
- Upper or lower case does not matter, but extra words or symbols do: "D" works, "D po" or "D." does not.
- The same buyer typing the code twice still gets one order (you may see a **Duplicate** tag).
- When stock reaches 0 you see "Code {code} — Sold out".
- On **Products** you can set a **Low-stock warning at** number to get a warning on the Live screen.

If a product''s price is 0, its auto orders total 0. Each code can belong to only one product.'),
  ('auto-print-pinned', 'Auto-print pinned comments', '2026-10-11'::date, 'pin, pinned comment, auto-print, auto print, tiktok pin, i-pin, awtomatikong print, 置顶, 置頂留言, 自动打印', '**Settings → General Settings → LIVE SESSION → Auto-print pinned comments** (TikTok).

When it is on, pinning a comment on your TikTok LIVE makes this device order and print it, like tapping **1-Click**.

- Turn it on **only on the device that has the printer**, so the order is not made twice.
- A pinned comment that is a sold-out Auto mode code is skipped.'),
  ('products-stock', 'Products, codes and stock', '2026-10-11'::date, 'products, product, item, stock, inventory, price, code, restock, add product, produkto, stocks, 商品, 库存, 庫存, 補貨', 'Open **Products** in the bottom bar.

- **+ Add** — enter **Name**, **Item code**, **Live code** (optional, for Auto mode), **Price**, **Stock**, **Platform**, then **Save**. The status (Active, Low stock, Out of stock) follows the stock.
- **Search name or item code** to find a product.
- **Edit** or **Delete** a product. Deleting asks "Delete this product?"
- Use the + / − buttons (**Adjust stock**) to change stock quickly.
- **⬇ Export** gives an **Excel (.xlsx)** or **PDF** list.
- Auto mode orders take stock off automatically.

Some accounts also have **Restock** ("How many pieces arrived?"), **History** of stock changes, a product **Picture**, and **Deduct stock on 1-Click** in Live session settings. Admin turns these on per account. If you don''t see one, it isn''t turned on for your account yet — ask Admin.'),
  ('reprint', 'Reprint a sticker', '2026-10-11'::date, 'reprint, print again, sticker, copy, missed print, i-print ulit, ulitin print, 重印, 補印, 重新打印', 'A reprint prints a copy of the order''s sticker. **No new order is created.**

- On **Live**: tap **Reprint** on the ordered comment row.
- On **Orders**: find the order (use search) and tap **Reprint** or **Print slip**.

If you see the **Not printed** tag or "Some labels didn''t print — tap Reprint on those rows", fix the printer first (see "Printer not printing"), then tap **Reprint** on those rows.'),
  ('orders-search', 'Orders screen and search', '2026-10-11'::date, 'orders, order list, search, find order, buyer, history, last 7 days, hanapin order, listahan, 订单, 訂單, 搜索, 查詢', 'Open **Orders** in the bottom bar.

- Choose a range: **Today**, **This session**, **Last 7 days**, or **Custom** (From / To).
- The top shows Orders, Total, Buyers and Avg order.
- **Search buyer #, name, item…** finds orders. If it is not in this session, the app searches the last 7 days ("Searching the last 7 days…").
- "No match in the last 7 days — older orders are no longer stored." Older orders cannot be found in search.
- Each buyer card has **Print slip** and **Reprint**.
- **⬇ Export** downloads Excel or PDF.
- The **Miners** tab shows your top buyers.
- Some accounts also have **Mark paid** / **Paid** / **Unpaid 24h+** and a Facebook waitlist. Admin turns these on per account. If you don''t see them, they aren''t turned on for your account yet — ask Admin.'),
  ('sales', 'Sales screen', '2026-10-11'::date, 'sales, report, revenue, income, total, best sellers, top buyers, benta, kita, 销售, 銷售報表, 营业额', 'Open **Sales** in the bottom bar.

- Pick a range: **Today**, **This session**, **Last 7 days**, **2 months**, or **Custom**.
- You see Orders, Total, Buyers and Avg order, a **Daily trend** (or **Hourly trend**), **Top buyers** (with **Search buyer**) and **Best sellers**.
- Tap a buyer and **Open in Orders** to see their orders.
- **⬇ Export** gives Excel or PDF.
- "History kept for 3 months." Older sales are not shown.'),
  ('miners-customers', 'Miners and Customers', '2026-10-11'::date, 'miners, top buyers, customers, loyal, repeat buyer, suki, mamimili, 买家, 客户, 顧客, 常客', '- **Miners** (Orders → Miners tab) shows top buyers for a range (This session, Today, 7 days, This month, Custom): total buyers, orders, money spent. **Repeat** marks buyers who ordered on 2 or more days in that range.
- **Customers** (Settings → Customers) lists buyers you''ve had. Use **Search loaded customers (name or @handle)** and **Load more**. Comment history is not stored; live comments appear on the Live screen only.'),
  ('raffle-games', 'Games (raffle)', '2026-10-11'::date, 'games, raffle, spin, wheel, winner, giveaway, roleta, pa-raffle, 抽奖, 抽獎, 转盘', 'On the **Live** screen, turn on **Games**. Orders placed while Games is ON join the raffle automatically (1 order = 1 entry, max 3 per buyer).

- Tap **Spin** to pick a **Winner**.
- **Exclude & spin again** removes that winner and spins again.
- **Print winner** prints it. **Reset** clears the entries.'),
  ('keep-screen-awake', 'Keep the screen awake', '2026-10-11'::date, 'screen awake, sleep, screen off, lock screen, keep awake, namamatay screen, natutulog phone, 屏幕常亮, 螢幕休眠, 熄屏', 'A sleeping phone stops capturing orders. Turn on **Settings → General Settings → LIVE SESSION → Keep screen awake while live**, then tap **Turn on**.

It keeps the phone awake while you are connected. Keep the app open on screen during your live. Also keep the phone charging for long lives. Some older phones don''t support it.'),
  ('language-theme', 'Language, theme and currency', '2026-10-11'::date, 'language, english, chinese, tagalog, theme, dark mode, light, currency, wika, palitan wika, 语言, 語言, 深色模式, 货币', '**Settings → General Settings → APPEARANCE**:

- **Language** — English, Filipino, Bahasa Indonesia, Tiếng Việt, 中文 (简体), 中文 (繁體), ไทย, Български.
- **Theme** — ☀ Light or ☾ Dark. **Accent color** changes the main color.
- **Animations** — turn off to save battery on older phones.
- **Currency** — applies to all prices.'),
  ('printer-overview', 'Which printers work', '2026-10-11'::date, 'printer, printers, which printer, supported, aimo, xprinter, sticker, receipt, anong printer, 打印机, 印表機, 列印, 支援', 'SellerFlowLive prints two kinds of labels:

- **Sticker** on a **Bluetooth sticker printer** (AIMO D520BT, 100×60mm standard). One label per order with buyer number, name, username and comment/price.
- **Slip / receipt** on a **WiFi receipt printer** (like Xprinter) on the same WiFi as your phone.

Choose it in **Settings → General Settings → Printer → CHOOSE PRINTER**, then open **Printer Settings**.

Printer connection runs in the **SellerFlowLive phone app**. In a web browser you see "Printer connection runs in the SellerFlowLive app — these controls work on your phone, not in the web preview." For a laptop, see "Laptop auto-print".'),
  ('printer-bluetooth', 'Bluetooth sticker printer (AIMO D520BT)', '2026-10-11'::date, 'bluetooth, bt, aimo, d520bt, sticker printer, pair, scan, ayaw mag-print, i-connect printer, 蓝牙, 藍牙, 打印, 列印, 贴纸', '1. Turn on the printer and keep it close to the phone.
2. Make sure it is **not connected to another app or phone**.
3. Turn on your phone''s **Bluetooth**.
4. Go to **Settings → General Settings → Printer**, choose **Bluetooth sticker printer**, open **Printer settings**.
5. Tap **Scan**, then pick your printer from the list (**Paired** or **Nearby**). You see "Printer saved."
6. Choose your **Sticker size**.
7. Tap **Test Print**. "Test sticker sent." means it works.

"Test sticker failed — check pairing" — turn the printer off and on, close other apps that use it, then **Scan** again. **Clear** removes the saved printer so you can pick it again.'),
  ('printer-wifi', 'WiFi receipt (slip) printer', '2026-10-11'::date, 'wifi, wi-fi, receipt printer, slip, ip address, 9100, xprinter, network printer, resibo, 小票, 收据打印机, 網路印表機', '1. Connect the receipt printer to the **same WiFi** as your phone.
2. Print the printer''s own test page. It shows the printer''s number (like 192.168.x.x).
3. Go to **Settings → General Settings → Printer**, choose **WiFi receipt printer**, open **Printer settings**.
4. Under **OUTPUT FORMAT** choose **Receipt** or **Sticker**.
5. Type **Printer number (from its test page)** and **Second number (usually 9100)**.
6. Tap **Test Connection**, then **Connect**, then **Test Print**.

**Find** checks the saved printer. If it fails, check that the phone and printer are on the same WiFi and the number is right (it can change after the router restarts).'),
  ('stickers', 'Sticker sizes, layout, Chinese names and QR', '2026-10-11'::date, 'sticker size, paper size, 100x60, 60x40, layout, chinese name, qr, print pattern, laki ng sticker, 贴纸尺寸, 标签尺寸, 中文名, 二维码', '**Sizes** (phone app, Bluetooth printer): 100x60mm (Standard), 80x60mm, 80x50mm, 70x50mm, 60x40mm. Pick in **Printer settings → Sticker size**. The size must match the paper in your printer.

**Layout**: **Settings → General Settings → LIVE SESSION → LIVE print pattern**. Choose what prints: Date & time, Buyer #, TikTok name, TikTok username, Comment / Price, SellerFlowLive logo, size and **Spacing** (Normal/Compact). Use **Printer Test** to check, then **Save settings**. Warnings like "Some text runs past the edge of the sticker on this size" mean the text is too long for that size.

**Chinese names** print correctly; no extra setting needed.

**Print QR on sticker** adds a QR of the buyer''s @username so you can scan it back in Parcel Scan. It is off by default and on every plan. In the phone app it works on every size except **60×40** (too small to scan quickly).'),
  ('laptop-printing', 'Printing from a laptop', '2026-10-11'::date, 'laptop, computer, windows, mac, chrome, silent print, kiosk, auto-print, browser, kompyuter, 电脑, 電腦列印, 静默打印', 'On a computer, printing uses your computer''s printer settings.

1. Install your label printer''s driver, set it as the default printer, and set the paper size to your label (at least 60×40mm).
2. In **Settings → General Settings**, find **LAPTOP AUTO-PRINT** ("Silent auto-print on a laptop"). Tap **Copy**.
3. Windows: press Win+R, paste, press Enter. Mac: open Terminal, paste, press Return. A separate Chrome window opens that prints without asking.
4. Log in once in that window and use it only for printing during your live.

If you see "Auto-print not silent?", repeat these steps.'),
  ('no-printer-connected', '"No printer connected"', '2026-10-11'::date, 'no printer connected, not printed, printer not set up, order saved, walang printer, hindi nag-print, 未连接打印机, 沒有印表機, 未打印', '"No printer connected — Your order was saved, but it couldn''t print — no printer is set up yet."

- The order **is saved**. Nothing is lost.
- Tap **Go to Printer Settings** and set up your printer (see the Bluetooth or WiFi printer sections).
- Then reprint from **Orders** or tap **Reprint** on the Live row.

Rows that failed show **Not printed**. Tap **Reprint** on each one after the printer works.'),
  ('bluetooth-off', 'Bluetooth is off / printer busy', '2026-10-11'::date, 'bluetooth off, bluetooth, printer busy, another app, other phone, naka-off bluetooth, 蓝牙关闭, 藍牙未開, 被占用', '**"Bluetooth is off — Your phone''s Bluetooth is off. Turn it on first so you can print."** Turn on Bluetooth in your phone settings, come back to the app, and **Reprint** any missed orders.

